%N A057188 Numbers k such that (22^k+1)/23 is a prime.
%C A057188 Some of the larger terms may only correspond to probable primes.
%C A057188 a(12) > 10^5. - _Robert Price_, Jun 02 2013
%C A057188 a(12) > 10^6. - _Jason H Parker_, Oct 28 2026
%H A057188 Harvey Dubner and Torbjörn Granlund, <a href="https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/journals/JIS/VOL3/DUBNER/dubner.html">Primes of the Form (b^n+1)/(b+1)</a>, J. Int. Seq. 3 (2000), Art. 00.2.7.
%o A057188 (PARI) isok(n) = (denominator(p=(22^n+1)/23)==1) && isprime(p); \\ _Michel Marcus_, Oct 30 2017
